<title>USA: Intermet offer clears Hart-Scott-Rodino.</title>
<headline>Intermet offer clears Hart-Scott-Rodino.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intermet Corp said the Hart-Scott-Rodino waiting period for its cash tender offer for Sudbury Inc expired on December 6.</p>
<p>The offer, made by Intermet's I M Acquisition Corp unit, was for all outstanding common Sudbury shares for $12.50 per share. The tender offer is scheduled to expire at midnight on Friday, December 20, Intermet said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
